{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/DISCORDBannerF.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on a journey inspired by Slavic mythology and Croatian folklore in this 2.5D action-adventure game inspired by the likes of <i>Inside</i>, <i>Neva</i>, and <i>Song of Iron</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Dark Queen we hope to remind you of stories you've heard as a kid that made you dream of being a hero. Step into a fantasy book, into the shoes of a medieval knight, returning home from grueling battles of the Crusade.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, there's no time to rest, your homeland was woven into darkness by an evil queen. Fight with monsters and epic bosses throughout diverse landscapes, from enchanted forests to desolate wastelands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of creatures lurk behind that next bush, what kind of monsters will you encounter? Not even the bloodshed of the Crusade has prepared you for this - you'll have to step up and improve your abilities if you plan to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline1.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF8.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline2.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/BossesGIFNew.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline3.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline4.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline5.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF6.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/Headline6.png?t=1748969352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/GIF7.gif?t=1748969352\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3106050?t=1748969352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3106050?t=1748969352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/ed7f85ae73772cda420712f67809b4f70c8e43d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748969352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/ed7f85ae73772cda420712f67809b4f70c8e43d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748969352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Ac